      "artist": "Anthony M. from Rome, Italy",
      "description": "The prison occupies two former apartments in an ordinary apartment building. The SS bricked up the windows, leaving tiny grates, and put bars in the overdoors. All the wall surfaces, and even the electrical system, in this place are original. Through the door to the left we can see that one cell was wallpapered, a relic from its previous use as a hotel.",
